## UNEP MARS casebook data

`data/real/mars_casebook_2026-10-11.json` is an adapted selection from the
UNEP International Methane Emissions Observatory (IMEO), Eye on Methane / MARS
sources-and-plumes dataset. The casebook is distributed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
Its archive URL, retrieval date, SHA-256, attribution and changes are recorded
in `data/real/README.md`. The dataset's license does not apply to this
repository's original software.

## Linked reports

The casebook stores link metadata only. The linked Kazakhstan and Libya item
pages identify CC BY-NC-ND 3.0 IGO terms; the linked Argentina item did not show
an item-level license when reviewed on 2026-10-12. No report text or PDF is
included. Check each item page before relying on or reproducing its content.

## Bundled interface imagery

The `apps/web/public/assets/*.webp` files were present in the user-supplied UI
source package, but the repository did not contain a source or license manifest
for them when this notice was prepared. Their redistribution rights are not
verified, so they are excluded from the MIT grant above. Verify permission or
replace these files before making the repository public.

## Remote map tiles

Map tiles are fetched at runtime from OpenFreeMap / OpenStreetMap and Esri.
Attribution is rendered in the map UI; each provider's current terms apply.
